      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: \nI recorded the bug in a video as I had the same problem.\n[demo video]\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1LaK0m71HUsPaWzV58QVw02rmOJRRUdgr/view?usp=sharing\n[Detailed Information]\nVR Device: HTC Vive\nOS:windows 10 home 64bit\nCPU: AMD RYZEN 7 3700X\nRAM: 32GB\nSteamVR version:1.13.10\nVRchat version:w_2020.3.2",
