      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}:\nIn the video below, there are sudden frame drops when grabbing the camera as a photo is instantly taken. The window to the left displays the pics being written shortly after I grab the camera.\nIf I slightly release the grip, even slightly, the camera is dropped. I can only take a photo as soon as I grab the camera. The Vive Wand controls do not allow the camera to be auto-held.\nOnly in Open Beta. Live works as intended.\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1ewEvJe8veYC-FxMFExEiy2c9gQgU7tpJ/view?usp=sharing",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
